    </values>
    <values>
        <field>Draft_Grounding_Block_Ratio__c</field>
        <value xsi:type="xsd:double">0.34</value>
    </values>
    <!-- Precision gates on a would-be draft. Claim check is deterministic (no model call). The verify
         gate adds one model call per drafted case; turn OFF if the Einstein Requests budget is not
         approved. Both fail closed: on any uncertainty the draft is declined, not sent.
         Verify model = full GPT-4o (not mini): the 2026-07-20 labeled-21 eval showed the mini judge too
         lenient (62% precision, 5/10 FPs caught) while full GPT-4o caught 9/10 FPs (86% precision, 0
         fabricated specifics). Cost: one GPT-4o call per would-be draft (~14/100 cases). Revert to
         sfdc_ai__DefaultOpenAIGPT4OmniMini to trade precision for lower cost + higher draft recall. -->
    <values>
        <field>Draft_Claim_Check_Enabled__c</field>
        <value xsi:type="xsd:boolean">true</value>
    </values>
    <values>
        <field>Draft_Claim_Check_Max_Unverified__c</field>
        <value xsi:type="xsd:double">0</value>
    </values>
    <values>
        <field>Draft_Verify_Enabled__c</field>
        <value xsi:type="xsd:boolean">true</value>
    </values>
    <!-- Phase-1 precision levers (2026-07-23): structural pre-decline targets the dominant unseen-
         cohort bad-draft family (screenshot-only errors, "worked yesterday" regressions) before the
         metered call; its answerable-signal veto was widened same-day after the pinned smoke showed
         the code-token-only version killing 4 good drafts.
         Draft_Verify_Second_Vote__c is OFF: the pinned smoke measured 8/8 agreement between two
         same-model verify samples (correlated, not independent), so the "double-decline blocks"
         rule degenerated into the full flagged-channel re-block (blocked 4 good / 3 bad, and judge
         noise on clean drafts became blocks). Keep the code; only re-enable with a decorrelated
         second voter (different model or lens). -->
    <values>
        <field>Draft_Structural_Decline_Enabled__c</field>
        <value xsi:type="xsd:boolean">true</value>
    </values>
    <values>
        <field>Draft_Verify_Second_Vote__c</field>
